  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader from PowerPoint is a C# barcode scanner library to read, scan QR Code, Data Matrix, Code 128, EAN/UPC and other barcodes from PowerPoint in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example C# source code to scan, read, decode barcode data message from PowerPoint file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/csharp_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
